"Your habit of engaging the speakers in lengthy debates impedes the progress
of the class and is more distracting thatn thought provoking."
The letter goes on to say... "It has also been brought to my attention that 
a UCPD employee complained that you were rude to her."

Oh yeah, here's the kicker:

"While it is not the mission of the University to suppress individual freedom
of speech or to censor individual opinions or beliefs; it is the mission of 
