instructors, and other students taking the course.  Your compliance with this
directive is required by University police, Student Conduct Code sect 420(5)
and 420(10).  Failure to comply with this directive may result in 
disciplinary action by the Student Conduct Office."

It is signed, 
Sergeant Michael Shipman
Crime Prevention Unit
Safety Programs Coordinator



First off, we are talking about a Berkeley classroom.  Every time I spoke I
